{"title":"Dragon Hide","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Baby Red Dragon, Young Red Dragon, Frost Drake, Frost Dragon, Elder Frost Dragon +5 more</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"young-red-dragon\" title=\"Young Red Dragon - dropped it in 892 of 892 looted corpses (1/1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d3b91d3cbc801eda1dc2.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Young Red Dragon</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"frost-dragon\" title=\"Frost Dragon - dropped it in 7 of 7 looted corpses (1/1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/fda6a41952c640b417dd.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Frost Dragon</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"elder-frost-dragon\" title=\"Elder Frost Dragon - dropped it in 3 of 3 looted corpses (1/1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/21b4cccc5cfde4d5bff7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Elder Frost Dragon</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"red-dragon\" title=\"Embermaw - dropped it in 1 of 1 looted corpses (1/1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/bfbd66309f9f99fae2da.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Embermaw</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+6 more\">+6 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"skarnwing\" title=\"Skarnwing - dropped it in 1 of 1 loo